# The rendered book. The SOURCE is chapters/**; `mdbook build` regenerates this.
/book/

# The record — a read-only checkout of the UniForge engine at the commit record.lock pins.
# It is fetched, never committed: the pin is the contract, the copy is a build input.
/.record/

# Python bytecode caches. The checker and the appendix generator run as scripts and import one
# another, so builds and checks drop these next to the sources. A committed one falsified the
# edition's own prose, which sells `git status` as the instrument.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
*.swp
